OL,3,AMore than 800 missing in Nepal as
OL,4,Aauthorities say glacier collapse
OL,5,Atriggered flash flood
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn both sides of the border, hundreds
OL,8,Fof foreign nationals are missing -
OL,9,FNepal says that includes 178 tourists
OL,10,Ffrom India, 127 from Nepal, 65
OL,11,FAmericans, 35 Australians, and 33 from
OL,12,Fthe UK
OL,14,FThe US Geological Survey says "glacial
OL,15,Fcollapse and debris flow" triggered the
OL,16,Ffloods - and there are fears that
OL,17,Fdebris in rivers could cause a second
OL,18,Fflood
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
